  "items": [
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 296235216,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_232_430-490",
      "chapterUid": 232,
      "range": "430-490",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "逢人且说三分话，未可全抛一片心。有意栽花花不发，无心插柳柳成荫。画虎画皮难画骨，知人知面不知心。钱财如粪土，仁义值千金。",
      "totalCount": 5760
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 397715908,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_231_430-480",
      "chapterUid": 231,
      "range": "430-480",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "知己知彼，将心比心。酒逢知己饮，诗向会人吟。相识满天下，知心能几人？相逢好似初相识，到老终无怨恨心。",
      "totalCount": 5344
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 395158559,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_128_432-476",
      "chapterUid": 128,
      "range": "432-476",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "谁人背后无人说？哪个人前不说人。有钱道真语，无钱语不真。不信但看筵中酒，杯杯先敬有钱人。",
      "totalCount": 5058
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 397715908,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_148_430-454",
      "chapterUid": 148,
      "range": "430-454",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人见白头嗔，我见白头喜。多少少年亡，不到白头死。",
      "totalCount": 3090
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 919796922,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_121_430-482",
      "chapterUid": 121,
      "range": "430-482",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "近水知鱼性，近山识鸟音。易涨易退山溪水，易反易复小人心。运去金成铁，时来铁似金。读书须用意，一字值千金。",
      "totalCount": 2794
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 397715908,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_230_430-462",
      "chapterUid": 230,
      "range": "430-462",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "昔时贤文，诲汝谆谆。集韵增广，多见多闻。观今宜鉴古，无古不成今。",
      "totalCount": 2685
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 446822082,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_231_1439-1502",
      "chapterUid": 231,
      "range": "1439-1502",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "如果交朋友都能够以初见面时的友好与谦恭去对待和维持，那么也就不会生出那么多的是非和怨恨了，这份友情也才能够历久弥新、地久天长。",
      "totalCount": 2304
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 234025324,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_241_430-483",
      "chapterUid": 241,
      "range": "430-483",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "结交须胜己，似我不如无。但看三五日，相见不如初。人情似水分高下，世事如云任卷舒。会说说都市，不会说说屋里。",
      "totalCount": 2286
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 372616090,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_118_1304-1384",
      "chapterUid": 118,
      "range": "1304-1384",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "当然，它既然是封建社会的产物，其中自然包含着不少消极的思想，如“山上有直树，世上无直人”“近来学得乌龟法，得缩头时且缩头”，等等。这些思想和人生观都是不足取的。",
      "totalCount": 2160
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 419345666,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_123_460-476",
      "chapterUid": 123,
      "range": "460-476",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "马行无力皆因瘦，人不风流只为贫。",
      "totalCount": 2142
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 3447146,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_131_430-466",
      "chapterUid": 131,
      "range": "430-466",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "山中有直树，世上无直人。自恨枝无叶，莫怨太阳偏。大家都是命，半点不由人。",
      "totalCount": 2016
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 397715908,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_126_430-462",
      "chapterUid": 126,
      "range": "430-462",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "莺花犹怕春光老，岂可教人枉度春。红粉佳人休使老，风流浪子莫教贫。",
      "totalCount": 1725
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 337488311,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_127_452-468",
      "chapterUid": 127,
      "range": "452-468",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "贫居闹市无人问，富在深山有远亲。",
      "totalCount": 1716
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 397715908,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_234_430-482",
      "chapterUid": 234,
      "range": "430-482",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "闹里有钱，静处安身。来如风雨，去似微尘。长江后浪推前浪，世上新人赶旧人。近水楼台先得月，向阳花木早逢春。",
      "totalCount": 1568
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 919810326,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_137_430-474",
      "chapterUid": 137,
      "range": "430-474",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "酒中不语真君子，财上分明大丈夫。积金千两，不如明解经书。养子不教如养驴，养女不教如养猪。",
      "totalCount": 1530
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 359922447,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_179_430-460",
      "chapterUid": 179,
      "range": "430-460",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "大家做事寻常，小家做事慌张。大家礼义教子弟，小家凶恶训儿郎。",
      "totalCount": 1530
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 18369460,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_251_430-466",
      "chapterUid": 251,
      "range": "430-466",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "但将冷眼观螃蟹，看你横行到几时。见事莫说，问事不知。闲事休管，无事早归。",
      "totalCount": 1445
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 394680430,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_231_642-674",
      "chapterUid": 231,
      "range": "642-674",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "与人相处总像初次相见那样谦恭，不论时过多久，也不要产生怨恨之心。",
      "totalCount": 1442
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 18369460,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_248_430-462",
      "chapterUid": 248,
      "range": "430-462",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "受恩深处宜先退，得意浓时便可休。莫待是非来入耳，从前恩爱反成仇。",
      "totalCount": 1386
    },
    {
      "bookId": "26796443",
      "userVid": 224880824,
      "bookmarkId": "26796443_235_430-486",
      "chapterUid": 235,
      "range": "430-486",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "一年之计在于春，一日之计在于寅。一家之计在于和，一生之计在于勤。责人之心责己，恕己之心恕人。守口如瓶，防意如城。",
      "totalCount": 1380
    }
  ],
